# Docker build-context hygiene (TASK-014; WAVE-00 sheet line 543: PR27-SEC-01, PR28-SEC-03 item 6, PR30-SEC-08 (b),
# D-ARCH-100 item 3; platform.md §3.2 rules list). Docker semantics: a pattern anchors at the context root, `**`
# matches any number of directories (zero included), `!` re-includes, and the last matching line wins. A bare `tests`
# would only hide the root tests/ folder, so test trees are excluded at every depth. Every Dockerfile also copies
# explicit paths only; tools/ci/check-dockerignore.test.ts proves both with an in-house matcher.
#
# `.npmrc` is deliberately NOT listed: every install stage copies it with the manifests (SEC-P3-04).
# `prisma/client/tsconfig.json` must stay visible to the api/worker build stage (D-ARCH-105, TASK-020 part 020-B).

# Test code, spikes and fixtures, at every depth.
**/tests
**/spikes
**/fixtures
**/__fixtures__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.mjs

# Repository metadata, agent files and environment files (never in an image).
.git
.github
.claude
.env*
**/.env*

# Host dependencies and build output: images install and build from the lockfile themselves.
node_modules
**/node_modules
coverage
**/coverage
**/dist
**/build
**/.react-router
**/*.tsbuildinfo
prisma/generated

# Key material.
*.pem
*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Documentation, except the API contract that the api image serves (D-TASK017-01 (7), D-ARCH-084).
docs
!docs/03-architecture/api/openapi.yaml
